<title>HUNGARY: Hungary Jan-Sept investments down 7.5 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Hungary Jan-Sept investments down 7.5 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Investments in Hungary in the January-September period dropped by an inflation-adjusted 7.5 percent from the same period of 1995, the Central Statistical Office said on Friday.</p>
<p>INVESTMENTS (billion forints, not inflation-adjusted)</p>
<p>					 Percentage of</p>
<p>		   Jan-Sept 1996   Jan-Sept 1995   Jan-Dec 1995</p>
<p> Construction     335.6	     93.2		  541.0</p>
<p> Machinery	  287.5	     92.5		  439.8</p>
<p>  - domestic	122.3	    104.0		  190.0</p>
<p>  - imports	 165.3	     84.5		  250.0 @</p>
<p> Other		 56.3	     88.9		   89.3</p>
<p> Total		679.4	     92.5		1,070.1</p>
<p>Comparative absolute figures for January-September 1995 were not available.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
</text>
